abstract: >-
  QIK-VRT VRTCore SMG H5 supplies a 32-theorem Lean 4.19.0 model core,
  axiom audit, EBNF grammar, fail-closed reference validator, source and claim
  bindings, a virtual-cosmogenesis transition model, and German scholarly and
  general-audience articles. It proves symbolic Planck-normal-form and finite
  model properties while explicitly leaving the Standard-Model/Einstein
  bridge, quantum-gravity dynamics, physical cosmogenesis identity, empirical
  prediction and independent reproduction open.
